1.9.1 — current

The agent can check the public web, but only for a question about Leftover's, a file or folder, or this Windows system.
Off-topic questions are refused before any search.
A drive search such as search C: for cache folders still searches this PC only. It goes to the web only when the message is also a question, such as "what is safe to remove."
The agent must answer from the pages it found and name the page title. It still cannot delete files, and it still refuses Windows, OEM, Nahimic, installed apps, and folders that contain a real program.
